**§2 ZERO decomposition:** Implement `Node` + `LinkedList` per the Exercism "simple-linked-list" spec:
- `LinkedList(values)` pushes values head-first (so head = last input), iteration head→tail (yields reversed input)
- `pop()` = LIFO remove-from-head; `head()`/`pop()` raise `EmptyListException("The list is empty.")` when empty
- `reversed()` returns a new list whose iteration is the reverse order
- `Node.value()` / `Node.next()`

